Fri Aug 21 08:59:41 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package of python-comfy-kitchen 0.2.31:
  * CPU/eager backend only; Factory python-torch is CPU-only and
    has no CUDA flavor
  * Add comfy-kitchen-cpu-only-build.patch
  * Require python-torch >= 2.5.0 (eager backend imports torch)
  * Drop CUDA *.h/*.cuh from the installed tree

